{"about_the_game":"<i>Tangram Collection</i> reimagines the classic tangram puzzle with a modern twist. Originating from China, tangrams challenge players to fit seven geometric pieces, or tans, into a specific shape without overlap.<br><br>In <i>Tangram Collection</i>, you'll be presented with five diverse bundles, totaling <strong>over 100 puzzles</strong>, which promise to get you through a minimalist and relaxing experience. The clean and intuitive interface sets you in a world where you solve complex problems, making it perfect for both tangram enthusiasts and casual puzzle lovers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 diverse bundles of tangrams<br></li><li>Over 100 puzzles to be solved<br></li><li>Minimalistic design for serenity</li></ul><br>Find the evolution of Tangrams with <i>Tangram Collection</i>.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/9f7341f571f493006a4498d75609d1165e962487.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/fa601bc220243e98e698756a57f5700fc8ffa450.jpg"},{"name":"Journeyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/429f10fd4a716c9d98d086fc1f4eb8042c6bf3a6.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/e25af0cd6e1ab3dcfc9c578fea572c91ae75ce17.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/123d1dfe3141ce15661d5a9d7c081c501fc5728e.jpg"},{"name":"Complete T","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/bba7cc190239d3c2e0e89e5838d028da5d2d4d04.jpg"},{"name":"Hatched!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3182240/a57cba26df23f574fe4b974b8758750205b03f6f.jpg"},{"name":"The other way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams